==German==

===Etymology===
From Polynesian ''[[kanaka]]'' "human being".

===Noun===
{{de-noun-m|genitive=Kanaken|plural=Kanaken}}
# xenophobic, derogative term for [[foreigner]]s, of predominantly [[Turkish]] or "similar" origins.
# a member of the [[indigenous]] [[Melanesian]] [[inhabitants]] of [[New Caledonia]] in the [[southwest]] [[Pacific]].

